From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:53:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vm: fast-path dense array appends and typed-array indexed
 access

SetPropertyByValue previously only fast-pathed in-bounds overwrites on
dense arrays, sending every arr[arr.length] = v append through OrdinarySet,
prototype walks, and PropertyDescriptor allocation. Add a guarded dense
append path that verifies extensibility, default Array shape, receiver
identity, and an index-free ordinary prototype chain.

Also fast-path non-negative i32 indexed reads and writes on Arrays,
TypedArrays, and Strings directly from VM registers without cloning or
running base_class/to_property_key.
